  - infrastructure monitoring
abstract: >-
  Code repository accompanying the Master's thesis "Vision-Based Detection
  of Road Anomalies for Outdoor Infrastructure Monitoring", Technische
  Hochschule Deggendorf, 2026. Covers dataset preparation, YOLO baseline
  training and cross-domain evaluation on RDD2022, fine-tuning on a
  self-collected bicycle-lane dataset, and real-time deployment via ROS 2
  on Raspberry Pi hardware.
